<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Equinox - 108,000 Hampton Roads/Dunkirk East 15-25/2 $7.40 fio three days shinc/25,000 shinc Capeklav.</p>
<p>Simeon CH - 55,000 tonnes Roberts Bank/Hansaport mid Feb $11.50 fio 25,000 shinc/25,000 shinc Frapaco.</p>
<p>TBN 55,000 tonnes Roberts Bank/Port Talbot 10-21/2 $11.00/$11.25 fio five days shinc Yukong.</p>
<p>ORE - Tien Shan - 120,000 tonnes Tuburao/Kaohsiung Mar $10.70 fio 40,000 shinc/38,000 shinc CSC.</p>
<p>TBN 120,000 tonnes Dampier/Kaohsiung end Feb/beginning Mar $4.40 fio 48,000 shinc/38,000 shinc.</p>
